-- Hand-edited: a counted write or a link use is inserted, read and deleted when it leaves the day
-- (the worker's purge), never rewritten; a review-list entry is inserted and read, never rewritten
-- or removed by the app. buddha_app keeps the rest of the default privileges in
-- docker/postgres/init/01-roles.sql.
